{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-hadron-half-life-verification-table1-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:hadron-half-life-verification-table1-data","kind":"table","title":"Data table 1 from ex:hadron-half-life-verification","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-hadron-half-life-verification"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"hadron-half-life-verification-table1-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"tbl:hadron-half-life-verification-table1-data\"></a>\n<strong>Table.</strong> <em>Data table 1 from ex:hadron-half-life-verification</em></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Standard constant</th>\n<th><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-decomposition</th>\n<th>Source</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">m_e</code> (electron mass)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3m_e/3</code></td>\n<td>3 crossings of trefoil <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{2,3}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">s</code> (weak coupling)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q^{1/2} - q^{-1/2}</code></td>\n<td>Skein amplitude (no W boson)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[2]_q</code> (vertex factor)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q + q^{-1}</code></td>\n<td>Categorical dim of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{SU}_q(2)</code> fund. rep.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">v</code> (weak scale)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N_v \\cdot m_e/3</code></td>\n<td>Topological invariant <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N_v</code> (open)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G_F</code> (Fermi constant)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1/(\\sqrt{2}v^2)</code></td>\n<td>Derived from weak scale</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G_F^2 m_e^5</code> (rate scale)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">243m_e/3/(2N_v^4)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code> + <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mu_0</code> + <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N_v</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n"}
